From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:35:56 +0800
Subject: gui-extensions/usage: model, cost and context window at a glance
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Desktop: the session header shows provider · model · effort · cost (the
session's current model; effort hidden at its default) in the turn meta's
style, left of the context circle. Hovering the circle shows the context %, the
window as used / max in pi's short form (8.1k / 1.0M) and where automatic
compaction starts, computed from the same compaction config as core.

Phone: the same circle sits in the view switcher row through a new
"session.mobile.nav" slot; a tap opens every figure in a popover with the
tooltip's look.

Ocelot-Patch: web/session-header-meta

